<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105947" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύ̆π-ωμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is formed</i> or <i>moulded,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. χαλκόπλευρον,</span> of a brazen urn,
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				54
			</span></i>; <i>figure, outling,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μορφῆς τ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					162
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>seal-impression,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Anon.
			</span></i> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gött.Nachr.</u>
				1922.35
			</span></i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
				40
			</span></i>): hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>impression</i> received in perception, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάντασμα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1121c
			</span></i>.</div>
